From 39e3ec271a79ae6a998a311bf6b3d20956e4b901 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:25:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): resolve sub-pitch carried side-face and step
 contact

Retain exact block bounds, cylindrical history, and closed mesh provenance
across carried stock construction and transforms, and add adaptive continuous
boundary subdivision for carried workholding box and mesh overlap checks.

Fixes #1580
